### Separação por equipe — regra de ouro

| Equipe | Pasta | Prefixo de commit |
|--------|-------|------------------|
| Backend | `src/back_end/` | `feat(back):`, `fix(back):`, `test(back):` |
| Frontend | `src/front_end/` | `feat(front):`, `fix(front):`, `test(front):` |
| Ambos | `docs/`, `pom.xml`, `src/main/resources/` | `docs:`, `chore:` |

### Configuração Maven (src/back_end + src/front_end)

O `pom.xml` deve ter:
```xml
<build>
    <sourceDirectory>${project.basedir}/src/back_end</sourceDirectory>
    <resources>
        <resource>
            <directory>${project.basedir}/src/front_end</directory>
            <targetPath>static</targetPath>
        </resource>
        <resource>
            <directory>${project.basedir}/src/main/resources</directory>
        </resource>
    </resources>
</build>
```

